        <p class="font-bold uppercase text-[9px] tracking-[3px] text-[#A9BBA3] mb-4">YOUR CABIN, NEXT</p>
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(28px,4vw,42px)] leading-[1.15] mb-6" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400;">
          Where is your Smokies calendar <em style="font-style: italic; color: #A9BBA3;">leaving money?</em>
