        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-[#A9BBA3]/80 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          A 30-minute discovery call. We pull your comp set in Gatlinburg, Pigeon Forge or Sevierville, walk through pacing month by month, and tell you whether RevFactor is the right fit. Flat $350 per month per property if it is.
